{% block brandDescription %}
      <p class="brand-description">Founded in 1968 by Bernardo Chavez Rico, B.C. Rich is an iconic American guitar manufacturer synonymous with radical, non-standard body shapes and high-performance, metal-oriented instruments. Known for models like the Warlock, Mockingbird, and Bich, the brand pioneered 24-fret, neck-through-body designs, blending boutique quality with aggressive aesthetics and electronics.<br><a href="#" class="decoder-howto-link" data-modal-target="howto-bcrich">(How to decode a B.C. Rich serial #)</a></p>
